{"page":155,"verses":[{"verse_key":"7:38","surah":7,"ayah":38,"ar_uthmani":"قَالَ ٱدْخُلُوا۟ فِىٓ أُمَمٍ قَدْ خَلَتْ مِن قَبْلِكُم مِّنَ ٱلْجِنِّ وَٱلْإِنسِ فِى ٱلنَّارِ ۖ كُلَّمَا دَخَلَتْ أُمَّةٌ لَّعَنَتْ أُخْتَهَا ۖ حَتَّىٰٓ إِذَا ٱدَّارَكُوا۟ فِيهَا جَمِيعًا قَالَتْ أُخْرَىٰهُمْ لِأُولَىٰهُمْ رَبَّنَا هَـٰٓؤُلَآءِ أَضَلُّونَا فَـَٔاتِهِمْ عَذَابًا ضِعْفًا مِّنَ ٱلنَّارِ ۖ قَالَ لِكُلٍّ ضِعْفٌ وَلَـٰكِن لَّا تَعْلَمُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"God will say, ‘Join the crowds of jinn and humans who have gone before you into the Fire.’ Every crowd curses its fellow crowd as it enters, then, when they are all gathered inside, the last of them will say of the first, ‘Our Lord, it was they who led us astray: give them double punishment in the Fire’- God says, ‘Every one of you will have double punishment, though you do not know it’-","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"قَالَ","en_gloss":"He (will) say","transliteration":"qāla","verse_key":"7:38"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱدْخُلُوا۟","en_gloss":"Enter","transliteration":"ud'khulū","verse_key":"7:38"},{"pos":3,"ar":"فِىٓ","en_gloss":"among","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"7:38"},{"pos":4,"ar":"أُمَمٍۢ","en_gloss":"(the) nations","transliteration":"umamin","verse_key":"7:38"},{"pos":5,"ar":"قَدْ","en_gloss":"(who)","transliteration":"qad","verse_key":"7:38"},{"pos":6,"ar":"خَلَتْ","en_gloss":"passed away","transliteration":"khalat","verse_key":"7:38"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"7:38"},{"pos":8,"ar":"قَبْلِكُم","en_gloss":"before you","transliteration":"qablikum","verse_key":"7:38"},{"pos":9,"ar":"مِّنَ","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"7:38"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱلْجِنِّ","en_gloss":"the jinn","transliteration":"l-jini","verse_key":"7:38"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَٱلْإِنسِ","en_gloss":"and the men","transliteration":"wal-insi","verse_key":"7:38"},{"pos":12,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"7:38"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱلنَّارِ ۖ","en_gloss":"the Fire",